        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Nevertheless, we compete with numerous other pharmaceutical companies, including large, global pharmaceutical manufacturers capable of addressing these complexities and hurdles with respect to products that we currently produce and products that are in our pipeline.",
