        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our products are eligible to be reimbursed by Medicaid as we participate in the Medicaid Drug Rebate Program, under which participating manufacturers must pay a rebate for each unit of product reimbursed by state Medicaid programs.",
