        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The Company owns and operates three pharmaceutical manufacturing facilities, including two facilities in Baudette, Minnesota and one in East Windsor, New Jersey, which collectively are capable of producing oral solid dose products, as well as semi-solids, liquids and topicals, controlled substances, and potent products that must be manufactured in a fully-contained environment.",
