        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We expect our reliance on third party manufacturers to increase in the future as we receive approvals for new products to be manufactured through our collaboration arrangements, and as we seek additional growth opportunities outside of the capabilities of our current manufacturing facilities.",
